<section class="sales-panel" aria-labelledby="steps-heading">
  <h2 id="steps-heading">Get started in 3 steps</h2>
  <ol class="sales-steps">
    <li>
      <strong>Install and activate.</strong>
      Run the installer, open Practical Stock Planner and enter your licence key.
      You&rsquo;ll need an internet connection for this step.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Fill in the templates.</strong>
      Download the Excel templates from the app, then export your products, stock,
      orders and purchase orders from Shopify or Xero and paste them in. Follow
      our step-by-step guide.
